 "script": [
  {
   "id": "hook",
   "text": "Taiwan just issued a typhoon land warning. Will Champi hit the island?"
  },
  {
   "id": "f1",
   "text": "Taiwan's weather agency issued a land warning Thursday for Typhoon Champi. It covers Yilan, Hualien, Taitung and Pingtung counties. Late morning, sustained winds were one hundred eighty-four kilometers per hour, with gusts up to two hundred twenty-seven. The storm's radius was three hundred twenty kilometers."
  },
  {
   "id": "f2",
   "text": "The agency says Champi should turn north earlier than first expected. That would spare Taiwan a direct hit. But heavy rain is still forecast for the north on Friday and Saturday, with extremely heavy rain in northern and northeastern mountains."
  },
  {
   "id": "f3",
   "text": "AFP reports more than one hundred fifty flights were cancelled Thursday. Work and classes were suspended on Lanyu and Green Island, and many counties cancelled Friday. The premier urged people to avoid creeks, beaches and mountains over the long weekend."
  },
  {
   "id": "cta",
   "text": "Will Champi spare Taiwan a direct hit? Yes or no?"
  }
 ],
